Conclusions established:
  1. T_{v_N}(t) converges uniformly on [0, L] to a fixed smooth profile T_infinity(t).
  2. The boundary node T(0) = 0 is strictly enforced in the limit,
     proving that the ground state satisfies an exact Dirichlet condition.
  3. The right boundary stabilizes to T(L) ~ L, creating a directed asymmetric wave.
